    "service_desc": "911inform is a secure, cloud-based emergency response and situational intelligence platform designed for federal and enterprise environments requiring real-time visibility and coordinated response during critical incidents. Delivered within a FedRAMP-aligned SaaS architecture, the platform provides a centralized command-and-control interface for managing emergencies across facilities and agencies.\n\nAt its core is 911inform\u2019s patented Location Discovery Solution (LDS), a Ray Baum\u2019s Act-compliant technology that delivers precise, dynamic location data for 911 calls across PBX, softphone, and mobile devices. The platform enhances emergency response through patented interactive mapping, real-time cellular 9-1-1 call detection with location reporting, and automated multi-channel notifications.\n\n911inform enables secure communications and interoperability between organizations and first responders, delivering real-time situational intelligence to improve coordination and decision-making.\n\nDesigned for scalability and rapid deployment, 911inform integrates with existing telephony, security, and IT infrastructure while maintaining role-based access control, auditability, and secure data handling.\n\n \n\nSERVICES:\n\nRAY BAUM's Act Compliance\n\nKari\u2019s Law Compliance\n\nCellular 9-1-1 Call reporting\n\nInteractive mapping with routing\n\nNotification and messaging services\n\nFirst Responder Coordination\n\nEmergency Location Services",
