    "service_desc": "Altana, the world\u2019s first Value Chain Management System (VCMS), is a common operating picture for the global supply chain, connecting the most important organizations across the public and private sectors into a shared source of truth.\n\nAltana enables government agencies and the defense industrial base to see their actual value chains situated within a dynamic map of the global supply chain, focus on their priorities with AI support, and act to master their global value chains:\n\n- National Security: Altana provides government agencies and the military industrial base with a dynamic, networked, common operating picture of the global supply chain.\n\n- Law Enforcement: Altana helps regulators and enforcement agencies enforce laws across global value chain networks, and engage the private sector constructively on compliance from a shared source of truth.\n\n- Customs Enforcement and Trade Facilitation: Altana enables customs authorities to illuminate, enforce, and facilitate compliant global value chains for goods crossing their borders.\n\n- Economic Security: Altana enables policymakers to see, simulate, and collaborate across global value chains ensuring the security of critical industries and resources.\n\nAltana\u2019s mission is to provide cutting-edge technology to deliver global-scale supply chain visibility, threat network visibility, federated customer data integration, and public-private engagement capabilities.",
